msgstr "Store;Apps;Spiele;Installieren;Aktualisieren;Deinstallieren;Rezension;Bewertung;"

#: src/sw-account-pages.c
msgid "You are signed in"
msgstr "Du bist angemeldet"

#: src/sw-account-pages.c
msgid "Enter your email address."
msgstr "Gib deine E-Mail-Adresse ein."

#: src/sw-account-pages.c
msgid "Enter your password."
msgstr "Gib dein Passwort ein."

# android: Settings private_space_retry_signin_title (short)
#: src/sw-account-pages.c src/sw-app-page.c src/sw-mine.c
msgid "Sign in"
msgstr "Anmelden"

#: src/sw-account-pages.c
msgid ""
"Sign in to rate and review apps, and to see your apps on all your devices."
msgstr ""
"Melde dich an, um Apps zu bewerten und zu rezensieren und deine Apps auf all "
"deinen Geräten zu sehen."

# android: Settings preview_pager_email_title (several translations, short)
#: src/sw-account-pages.c
msgid "Email"
msgstr "E-Mail"

# android: Settings unlock_set_unlock_password_title (short)
#: src/sw-account-pages.c
msgid "Password"
msgstr "Passwort"

# android: Settings lockpassword_forgot_password
#: src/sw-account-pages.c
msgid "Forgot your password?"
msgstr "Passwort vergessen?"

#: src/sw-account-pages.c
msgid "No account yet?"
msgstr "Noch kein Konto?"

#: src/sw-account-pages.c
msgid "Create an account"
msgstr "Konto erstellen"

#: src/sw-account-pages.c
msgid "Enter a name. It shows on your reviews."
msgstr "Gib einen Namen ein. Er wird bei deinen Rezensionen angezeigt."

#: src/sw-account-pages.c
msgid ""
"With an account you can rate and review apps, and see your apps on all your "
"devices. The store emails you a code to confirm the address."
msgstr ""
"Mit einem Konto kannst du Apps bewerten und rezensieren und deine Apps auf "
"all deinen Geräten sehen. Der Store sendet dir einen Code per E-Mail, um die "
"Adresse zu bestätigen."

# android: Settings security_settings_fingerprint_enroll_dialog_name_label (short)
#: src/sw-account-pages.c
msgid "Name"
msgstr "Name"

#: src/sw-account-pages.c
msgid "Shown on your reviews"
msgstr "Wird bei deinen Rezensionen angezeigt"

#: src/sw-account-pages.c
msgid "At least 8 characters"
msgstr "Mindestens 8 Zeichen"

#: src/sw-account-pages.c
msgid "Create the account"
msgstr "Konto erstellen"

#: src/sw-account-pages.c
msgid "Send a new code"
msgstr "Neuen Code senden"

#. TRANSLATORS: %d is the seconds left until a new code can be asked for, "s" the abbreviation of seconds
#: src/sw-account-pages.c
#, c-format
msgid "Send a new code in %d s"
msgstr "Neuer Code in %d s"

#. TRANSLATORS: %s is the store's message (a whole sentence), %d how many more codes may be tried
#: src/sw-account-pages.c
#, c-format
msgid "%s %d try left."
msgid_plural "%s %d tries left."
msgstr[0] "%s Noch %d Versuch."
msgstr[1] "%s Noch %d Versuche."

#. TRANSLATORS: %d is the code's length in digits, %s the email address
#: src/sw-account-pages.c
#, c-format
msgid ""
"The store sent a %d-digit code to %s. Enter it here to confirm the address. "
"It works for 15 minutes."
msgstr ""
"Der Store hat einen %d-stelligen Code an %s gesendet. Gib ihn hier ein, um "
"die Adresse zu bestätigen. Er ist 15 Minuten lang gültig."

#. TRANSLATORS: %d is the code's length in digits, %s the email address
#: src/sw-account-pages.c
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Confirm your address to rate and review apps: enter the %d-digit code the "
"store emailed to %s, or ask for a new one."
msgstr ""
"Bestätige deine Adresse, um Apps zu bewerten und zu rezensieren: Gib den %d-"
"stelligen Code ein, den der Store an %s gesendet hat, oder fordere einen "
"neuen an."

#: src/sw-account-pages.c
msgid "A new code is on its way"
msgstr "Ein neuer Code ist unterwegs"

#: src/sw-account-pages.c
msgid "Your address is confirmed"
msgstr "Deine Adresse ist bestätigt"

#: src/sw-account-pages.c
msgid "Confirm your email"
msgstr "E-Mail bestätigen"

# android: Settings security_settings_remoteauth_enroll_enrolling_agree (short)
#: src/sw-account-pages.c
msgid "Confirm"
msgstr "Bestätigen"

# android: Aperture location_permission_dialog_later (other app, short)
#: src/sw-account-pages.c
msgid "Later"
msgstr "Später"

#: src/sw-account-pages.c
msgid "Your password is changed, and you are signed in"
msgstr "Dein Passwort wurde geändert und du bist angemeldet"

#: src/sw-account-pages.c
msgid ""
"Enter the address you signed up with. If it has an account, the store emails "
"a code to it to set a new password."
msgstr ""
"Gib die Adresse ein, mit der du dich registriert hast. Wenn es dazu ein "
"Konto gibt, sendet der Store einen Code an diese Adresse, damit du ein neues "
"Passwort festlegen kannst."

#: src/sw-account-pages.c
msgid "Send the code"
msgstr "Code senden"

#. TRANSLATORS: %s is the email address (partly hidden), %d the code's length in digits
#: src/sw-account-pages.c
#, c-format
msgid ""
"If %s has an account, a %d-digit code is on its way to it. Enter it here."
msgstr ""
"Wenn %s ein Konto hat, ist ein %d-stelliger Code dorthin unterwegs. Gib ihn "
"hier ein."

# android: Settings next_label (short)
#: src/sw-account-pages.c
msgid "Next"
msgstr "Weiter"

#: src/sw-account-pages.c
msgid ""
"Choose a new password. Every device signed in to the account is signed out, "
"and this one signed in."
msgstr ""
"Wähle ein neues Passwort. Alle Geräte, die mit dem Konto angemeldet sind, "
"werden abgemeldet, und dieses wird angemeldet."

#: src/sw-account-pages.c
msgid "New password"
msgstr "Neues Passwort"

#: src/sw-account-pages.c
msgid "Set the password"
msgstr "Passwort festlegen"

#: src/sw-account-pages.c
msgid "On Wi-Fi only"
msgstr "Nur über WLAN"

#: src/sw-account-pages.c
msgid "Not on a network that counts the data (a phone's mobile data)"
msgstr ""
"Nicht in einem Netzwerk mit Datenvolumen (mobile Daten eines Smartphones)"

#: src/sw-account-pages.c
msgid "On any network"
msgstr "In jedem Netzwerk"

#. TRANSLATORS: Mine is the tab of the apps on the device, "Check for updates" its button
#: src/sw-account-pages.c
msgid "Only when I ask"
msgstr "Nur manuell"

#: src/sw-account-pages.c
msgid "Mine's Check for updates"
msgstr "Über „Auf Updates prüfen“ in „Meine Apps“"

#. TRANSLATORS: the theme: light or dark as the system's
#: src/sw-account-pages.c
msgid "As the system"
msgstr "Systemstandard"

# android: Etar preferences_light_theme (other app, short)
#: src/sw-account-pages.c
msgid "Light"
msgstr "Hell"

# android: Etar preferences_dark_theme (other app, short)
#: src/sw-account-pages.c
msgid "Dark"
msgstr "Dunkel"

#: src/sw-account-pages.c
msgid "Software's settings are not installed."
msgstr "Die Einstellungen von Software sind nicht installiert."

#: src/sw-account-pages.c
msgid "Look for updates"
msgstr "Nach Updates suchen"

#: src/sw-account-pages.c
msgid ""
"Software looks for updates when it starts and when apps change. It does not "
"install them by itself: update from Mine."
msgstr ""
"Software sucht beim Start und bei Änderungen an Apps nach Updates. "
"Installiert werden sie nicht automatisch: Aktualisiere unter „Meine Apps“."

# android: Etar preferences_theme (other app, several translations, short)
#: src/sw-account-pages.c
msgid "Theme"
msgstr "Darstellung"

#: src/sw-account-pages.c
msgid "VibeOS apps only"
msgstr "Nur VibeOS-Apps"

#: src/sw-account-pages.c
msgid "None of Debian's in the store's lists"
msgstr "Keine Debian-Apps in den Listen des Stores"

#: src/sw-account-pages.c
msgid "About Software"
msgstr "Info zu „Software“"

