#: src/sw-account-pages.c
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "Einstellungen"

#: src/sw-account-pages.c
msgid "The catalog"
msgstr "Der Katalog"

#: src/sw-account-pages.c
msgid ""
"The apps, their descriptions and pictures come from the store at vibeos.top, "
"which takes them from Debian's and VibeOS's software sources and the apps' "
"own AppStream data."
msgstr ""
"Die Apps, ihre Beschreibungen und Bilder kommen aus dem Store auf "
"vibeos.top, der sie aus den Softwarequellen von Debian und VibeOS und den "
"AppStream-Daten der Apps selbst bezieht."

