msgstr "VibeOS Software: das Store-Konto auf %s"

#: src/sw-account.c
msgid "You were signed out of the store. Sign in again to review apps."
msgstr ""
"Du wurdest vom Store abgemeldet. Melde dich wieder an, um Apps zu "
